WEBVTT

00:03.020 --> 00:06.020
<b><i>Sun-chan.
It must've been so frustrating to you.</i></b>

00:06.150 --> 00:08.440
<b><i>You were so close to Koushien.</i></b>

00:13.780 --> 00:14.860
<b>Hey.</b>

00:15.360 --> 00:16.570
<b>What?</b>

00:18.780 --> 00:21.660
<b><i>She's the beautiful girl from the bleachers!</i></b>

00:21.660 --> 00:24.000
<b>Oh, that's an interesting expression.</b>

00:27.040 --> 00:27.920
<b>Ahem.</b>

00:27.920 --> 00:30.090
<b>I-Is there something I can help you with?</b>

00:30.090 --> 00:32.720
<b>I spoke to you because I'm interested in you.</b>

00:33.340 --> 00:35.430
<b>A-Am I being a nuisance?</b>

00:35.590 --> 00:38.390
<b>No, no, not at all!</b>

00:38.970 --> 00:40.140
<b>That's good.</b>

00:40.140 --> 00:42.020
<b><i>She's cute!</i></b>

00:42.020 --> 00:43.890
<b>Can I make a proposal?</b>

00:44.100 --> 00:46.100
<b>By all means! What is it?</b>

00:46.100 --> 00:49.860
<b>It's still hot out here,
so could we move to a cooler place?</b>

00:50.070 --> 00:53.780
<b>Maybe a coffee shop?
I'd like to talk to you more.</b>

00:53.990 --> 00:54.780
<b>No?</b>

00:54.780 --> 00:56.660
<b>Sorry, I can't.</b>

00:56.950 --> 00:58.030
<b>Why is that?</b>

00:58.030 --> 01:00.450
<b>I'm waiting here for someone.</b>

01:00.700 --> 01:02.120
<b>My best friend.</b>

01:02.450 --> 01:04.120
<b>You already have plans?</b>

01:04.120 --> 01:06.460
<b>Nope. I'm waiting here on my own volition.</b>

01:06.830 --> 01:09.340
<b>The guy I'm waiting for...</b>

01:09.340 --> 01:11.090
<b>NISHIKIZUTA
TOSHOBU</b>

01:09.920 --> 01:13.760
<b>When he feels down,
he takes the whole burden on himself.</b>

01:14.090 --> 01:15.300
<b>That's why...</b>

01:16.430 --> 01:17.760
<b>I don't want him to be alone.</b>

01:19.930 --> 01:20.890
<b>I see.</b>

01:20.930 --> 01:24.180
<b>So why don't we continue this another day?</b>

01:24.180 --> 01:26.100
<b>Yes, why don't we?</b>

01:27.060 --> 01:30.150
<b>I'd like to make fun memories with you then.</b>

01:30.940 --> 01:35.820
<b>I don't have any friends at school,
so I'm lonely.</b>

01:36.110 --> 01:38.240
<b>Then I'll make them for you.</b>

01:38.860 --> 01:42.240
<b>Awesome friends. No, best friends!</b>

01:44.200 --> 01:46.460
<b>You don't know how thrilled I am.</b>

01:47.120 --> 01:48.080
<b>That's a promise.</b>

01:48.170 --> 01:49.330
<b>Leave it to me!</b>

01:49.330 --> 01:50.960
<b>Then I'll be on my way.</b>

01:51.920 --> 01:54.300
<b>H-Hey! Can I get your name and contact info?</b>

01:54.300 --> 01:56.800
<b>Don't worry. We'll meet again.</b>

01:57.420 --> 01:58.880
<b>Seriously?</b>

01:59.340 --> 02:01.470
<b>Oh, well. Can't do anything about it now.</b>

02:03.930 --> 02:07.180
<b>I hope Sun-chan comes out soon.</b>

03:40.780 --> 03:44.490
<b><i>That's right.
I'm not the main character of this story.</i></b>

03:45.370 --> 03:47.580
<b><i>I'm fully aware of that.</i></b>

03:48.990 --> 03:51.870
<b><i>But just for a little bit.</i></b>

03:52.790 --> 03:54.750
<b><i>It's just for a little bit.</i></b>

03:55.670 --> 03:58.170
<b><i>Would you listen to my story?</i></b>

04:08.810 --> 04:09.720
<b>All right!</b>

04:11.100 --> 04:12.230
<b>Nice ball!</b>

04:14.980 --> 04:16.020
<b>Yes!</b>

04:16.020 --> 04:18.610
<b>That's the way, Oga!</b>

04:18.610 --> 04:21.070
<b>Pitch just like that for our next game!</b>

04:21.070 --> 04:23.570
<b>Y-Yes, sir! Th-Thank you!</b>

04:24.610 --> 04:26.740
<b><i>Back in elementary school,</i></b>

04:25.820 --> 04:27.740
<b>Have more confidence in yourself!</b>

04:26.740 --> 04:32.660
<b><i>because of my reserved personality, it was
hard making friends with my fellow teammates.</i></b>

04:32.960 --> 04:34.960
<b>You're amazing, Oga!</b>

04:34.960 --> 04:37.920
<b>As expected from our team's ace,
number four, right?</b>

04:38.380 --> 04:39.630
<b>Y-Yeah.</b>

04:41.630 --> 04:46.260
<b><i>Only the catcher, Shiba, would really talk to me.</i></b>

04:46.260 --> 04:47.340
<b>Thanks.</b>

04:48.800 --> 04:53.350
<b><i>So Shiba was someone
who was precious to me.</i></b>

04:53.890 --> 04:55.600
<b>So tired...</b>

04:56.480 --> 04:58.610
<b>Huh? What's that?</b>

04:59.230 --> 05:00.440
<b>Oh, this?</b>

05:00.900 --> 05:02.690
<b>A Nomo keychain.</b>

05:02.860 --> 05:04.650
<b>It's my treasure.</b>

05:05.860 --> 05:06.780
<b>Nomo, huh?</b>

05:07.530 --> 05:09.330
<b>That's cool.</b>

05:10.280 --> 05:11.410
<b>Thanks.</b>

05:11.660 --> 05:14.330
<b>Go straight home, without stopping anywhere!</b>

05:14.330 --> 05:16.620
<b>Yes, sir! Goodbye!</b>

05:16.830 --> 05:18.830
<b>- I'm starving.
- I'm so tired!</b>

05:18.830 --> 05:20.880
<b>I want to get something to eat!</b>

05:22.460 --> 05:25.550
<b>It's gone! It was right here just before!</b>

05:25.550 --> 05:27.050
<b>What's wrong, Oga?</b>

05:27.050 --> 05:28.840
<b>My keychain is gone!</b>

05:29.600 --> 05:30.930
<b>That's terrible!</b>

05:30.930 --> 05:33.350
<b>- What should I do?
- We just have to look for it!</b>

05:33.350 --> 05:35.770
<b>Okay, I'll check the field!</b>

05:35.770 --> 05:36.850
<b>Shiba!</b>

05:37.940 --> 05:39.310
<b>Thank you.</b>

05:39.310 --> 05:41.480
<b>It's nothing. After all, we're friends.</b>

05:42.230 --> 05:43.730
<b>Shiba...</b>

05:44.690 --> 05:48.820
<b>There's no way
I would've dropped it around here, right?</b>

05:49.030 --> 05:50.870
<b>You're a riot, Shiba.</b>

05:50.870 --> 05:52.660
<b>You can count on me!</b>

05:53.660 --> 05:57.250
<b>He'll never find that keychain now.</b>

05:58.040 --> 05:59.420
<b>Right?</b>

05:59.790 --> 06:03.880
<b>Oga trusts me, after all. It was child's play.</b>

06:04.590 --> 06:05.460
<b>Shiba...</b>

06:05.460 --> 06:08.380
<b>It's no fair that the coach
always singles him out.</b>

06:08.380 --> 06:11.100
<b>I wish that jerk would just quit the team.</b>

06:11.100 --> 06:12.560
<b>I know.</b>

06:13.720 --> 06:16.810
<b>If Oga weren't around, I'd be...</b>

06:17.520 --> 06:20.400
<b>They hate me.</b>

06:20.810 --> 06:22.110
<b>What should I do?</b>

06:22.400 --> 06:24.020
<b><i>Pathetic, right?</i></b>

06:24.820 --> 06:27.610
<b><i>I believed in Shiba, but he betrayed me.</i></b>

06:27.610 --> 06:29.820
<b><i>And yet, instead of being angry, I was scared.</i></b>

06:30.410 --> 06:34.240
<b><i>I was scared of being hated.</i></b>

06:35.040 --> 06:37.750
<b><i>I was scared of being rejected.</i></b>

06:38.910 --> 06:40.290
<b><i>That's why I...</i></b>

06:41.330 --> 06:45.920
<b>Hey, everybody!
From today, start calling me Sun-chan!</b>

06:46.460 --> 06:50.430
<b>All right! Let's work hard together today!</b>

06:51.090 --> 06:54.970
<b><i>I hid my true self and became "Sun-chan."</i></b>

06:55.350 --> 06:59.560
<b><i>Whatever the circumstances,
I'd smile and try to shine light on everyone.</i></b>

07:14.780 --> 07:17.910
<b>JULY</b>

07:15.580 --> 07:17.910
<b><i>It's finally here.</i></b>

07:17.910 --> 07:21.330
<b>REGIONAL TOURNAMENT FINAL!!</b>

07:18.870 --> 07:20.870
<b><i>The day of reckoning.</i></b>

07:23.000 --> 07:24.290
<b>For now...</b>

07:25.420 --> 07:27.510
<b>Previously, with Amatsuyu Kisaragi...</b>

07:28.090 --> 07:32.590
<b><i>Hose is Pansy's mortal enemy and a naturally dense
main character of a romantic comedy.</i></b>

07:33.010 --> 07:37.260
<b><i>My one job was to keep them apart,
but I facilitated their reunion.</i></b>

07:37.890 --> 07:43.230
<b><i>As a result, the immediate problem
of the school library closure was solved,</i></b>

07:43.480 --> 07:46.150
<b><i>but at the cost
of an even greater problem arising.</i></b>

07:46.150 --> 07:50.780
<b><i>So in order to set Pansy free
from the curse of Hose's good intentions,</i></b>

07:50.780 --> 07:54.200
<b><i>I challenged him, with Pansy on the line.</i></b>

07:54.620 --> 07:56.530
<b><i>Or that was the idea.</i></b>

07:56.740 --> 08:00.200
<b><i>But for some reason, three beautiful girls</i></b>

08:00.200 --> 08:05.000
<b><i>made the situation much more complicated
by confessing their love to me!</i></b>

08:05.380 --> 08:09.710
<b>It's okay. You can give me your answer
after your challenge is settled.</b>

08:12.130 --> 08:16.180
<b>I'll wait for you! After all, I really love you!</b>

08:18.010 --> 08:21.270
<b>I'll be waitin' for your answer.</b>

08:22.230 --> 08:24.560
<b>O-Okay, I get it!</b>

08:24.810 --> 08:26.560
<b>I'll be waiting for you, Joro!</b>

08:26.900 --> 08:29.530
<b><i>What the hell kind of twist is this?</i></b>

08:30.110 --> 08:35.450
<b>Okay, you have that squared away,
so now let's cut to the chase.</b>

08:35.450 --> 08:36.660
<b>The chase?</b>

08:36.660 --> 08:38.990
<b>Yeah, about your challenge.</b>

08:39.290 --> 08:43.500
<b>The six of us girls each have a barrette,
so let each one of us add a rule.</b>

08:43.790 --> 08:45.250
<b>Why?</b>

08:45.420 --> 08:47.420
<b>Because you might cheat otherwise.</b>

08:47.420 --> 08:49.210
<b><i>They're on to me!</i></b>

08:49.550 --> 08:51.260
<b>Stare.</b>

08:51.260 --> 08:53.720
<b>We agree with that proposal.</b>

08:54.090 --> 08:55.010
<b>Indeed.</b>

08:55.010 --> 08:56.680
<b><i>I'm surrounded by too many enemies!</i></b>

08:57.050 --> 08:59.010
<b>So what kind of rules?</b>

08:59.010 --> 09:00.640
<b>Well, I'll start.</b>

09:00.640 --> 09:01.560
<b>Go ahead.</b>

09:01.560 --> 09:05.770
<b>First, each girl can only give
one barrette to one guy.</b>

09:06.150 --> 09:07.150
<b>That makes sense.</b>

09:07.150 --> 09:08.270
<b>Yep!</b>

09:08.270 --> 09:09.270
<b>Roger.</b>

09:09.270 --> 09:10.730
<b>- I'm next.
- Sure.</b>

09:11.070 --> 09:14.150
<b>Once you've given a barrette,
there are no do-overs.</b>

09:14.150 --> 09:15.450
<b>Good one.</b>

09:15.450 --> 09:16.110
<b>Roger!</b>

09:16.360 --> 09:18.160
<b>Okay, me!</b>

09:18.160 --> 09:24.000
<b>After the six of us have given our barrettes
and the regional's final game is over,</b>

09:24.000 --> 09:25.870
<b>so is this challenge!</b>

09:25.870 --> 09:26.790
<b>Agreed!</b>

09:26.790 --> 09:27.580
<b>Roger.</b>

09:27.580 --> 09:28.880
<b><i>So it can't be prolonged.</i></b>

09:28.880 --> 09:30.630
<b>- All right, I've got one.
- Go ahead.</b>

09:30.960 --> 09:35.300
<b>Let's make it so we can only give a barrette
when Joro and Hose are together.</b>

09:35.300 --> 09:36.800
<b>Good idea!</b>

09:36.800 --> 09:37.590
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:37.590 --> 09:39.090
<b>- I see.
- Sniff.</b>

09:39.090 --> 09:40.180
<b>I'm next.</b>

09:40.600 --> 09:43.350
<b>Of course there's no stealing barrettes.</b>

09:43.350 --> 09:45.890
<b>Only the intention of the person
who gives it counts.</b>

09:46.100 --> 09:47.390
<b>- Yeah!
- Agreed.</b>

09:47.390 --> 09:50.020
<b><i>All of these rules are aimed at me!</i></b>

09:50.230 --> 09:52.440
<b>And last but not least, Sumirekocchi!</b>

09:54.070 --> 09:57.150
<b>The punishment definitely applies
to whomever loses.</b>

09:58.530 --> 10:00.620
<b>These are all good rules.</b>

10:00.910 --> 10:04.250
<b>Joro, Hose, there are no problems
with any of these, right?</b>

10:04.250 --> 10:06.500
<b>Nope! No problems at all!</b>

10:07.000 --> 10:10.130
<b>No, I sure don't.</b>

10:12.170 --> 10:16.300
<b>I've already been through
a lifetime's worth of misery!</b>

10:16.880 --> 10:18.630
<b>HINATA</b>

10:20.550 --> 10:22.890
<b><i>Joro? Good morning! Were you awake?</i></b>

10:22.890 --> 10:23.680
<b>Yeah.</b>

10:23.680 --> 10:27.940
<b><i>So let's go to the ball park together
for today's final game!</i></b>

10:27.940 --> 10:28.850
<b>Together?</b>

10:29.140 --> 10:30.060
<b>Yeah!</b>

10:30.060 --> 10:31.400
<b>Himawari.</b>

10:31.900 --> 10:34.530
<b><i>Do you think you can hold on to Joro?</i></b>

10:34.530 --> 10:36.150
<b><i>Yeah, I've got this!</i></b>

10:36.280 --> 10:39.990
<b>Then as soon as you get to the ball park,
if you meet up with Cherry and the others...</b>

10:40.280 --> 10:41.320
<b>Right!</b>

10:43.240 --> 10:48.540
<b>So listen, I'm on my way to your place now,
so take your time getting ready.</b>

10:48.540 --> 10:50.290
<b>Yeah, of course!</b>

10:50.290 --> 10:51.250
<b><i>See you!</i></b>

10:52.750 --> 10:54.750
<b>REGIONAL TOURNAMENT FINAL!!</b>

10:54.840 --> 10:56.840
<b>All right.</b>

10:59.260 --> 11:01.260
<b>Hurry!</b>

11:01.800 --> 11:04.220
<b>- Where is he?
- Joro, where are you!</b>

11:06.220 --> 11:08.270
<b>He must've beaten us here!</b>

11:08.270 --> 11:10.640
<b>To think he would devise a plan to escape...</b>

11:11.770 --> 11:13.610
<b>How could he have realized?</b>

11:13.610 --> 11:16.400
<b>Let's stay calm and split up to search for him!</b>

11:16.030 --> 11:21.110
<b>GENKI YAKITORI</b>

11:16.400 --> 11:19.650
<b>- Right.
- Okay. Joro!</b>

11:20.070 --> 11:21.110
<b>They're gone.</b>

11:23.870 --> 11:27.290
<b>I-I won't get caught that easily.</b>

11:30.370 --> 11:34.340
<b>If they make me and Hose meet up now,
I'll definitely lose!</b>

11:35.790 --> 11:39.590
<b>So before that can happen,
I have to persuade the other girls!</b>

11:40.760 --> 11:42.050
<b>The coast is clear.</b>

11:42.380 --> 11:45.760
<b>All right! Let's go! Play ball!</b>

11:45.760 --> 11:47.220
<b>Here you go.</b>

11:48.600 --> 11:49.890
<b>And this.</b>

11:51.810 --> 11:52.940
<b>This is...</b>

11:52.940 --> 11:57.650
<b>Yep! Since we helped hide you,
you can help my sister with sales!</b>

11:59.820 --> 12:01.150
<b>What's with this day?</b>

12:03.530 --> 12:06.410
<b>This is going to be a hot day.</b>

12:06.990 --> 12:08.540
<b>All right.</b>

12:09.370 --> 12:12.410
<b><i>Even after becoming a middle school student,</i></b>

12:12.410 --> 12:16.250
<b><i>I was still "Sun-chan,"
behaving as sunny and bright as the sun.</i></b>

12:19.920 --> 12:20.760
<b>Hey, listen.</b>

12:20.760 --> 12:22.510
<b>What is it?</b>

12:22.880 --> 12:25.850
<b>Have you already decided on a club?</b>

12:25.850 --> 12:29.430
<b>I'm going to be on the baseball team!
My dream is to join the major league!</b>

12:29.430 --> 12:31.600
<b>Huh. That's awesome!</b>

12:32.690 --> 12:34.350
<b>Boom!</b>

12:35.480 --> 12:37.230
<b>Let me in on this!</b>

12:37.820 --> 12:40.190
<b>That hurt, Himawari!</b>

12:40.990 --> 12:43.070
<b>You ogre!</b>

12:44.450 --> 12:46.070
<b>C-Crap!</b>

12:46.070 --> 12:47.160
<b>Joro?</b>

12:47.160 --> 12:49.160
<b>I-It's nothing!</b>

12:49.160 --> 12:51.290
<b>Everything's fine.</b>

12:51.290 --> 12:52.910
<b>You just surprised me.</b>

12:54.420 --> 12:55.670
<b>Weird Joro!</b>

12:56.040 --> 12:57.290
<b>A-Am I?</b>

12:57.290 --> 12:59.040
<b>Are you...</b>

13:00.960 --> 13:02.720
<b>Nice!</b>

13:02.720 --> 13:04.340
<b>That's great!</b>

13:05.050 --> 13:07.090
<b>Tell me your name.</b>

13:07.090 --> 13:08.640
<b>Let's be friends!</b>

13:08.640 --> 13:10.220
<b>You want to be friends with me?</b>

13:10.220 --> 13:11.470
<b>Yeah!</b>

13:11.470 --> 13:14.690
<b>I'm Taiyo Oga. But call me Sun-chan!</b>

13:15.100 --> 13:18.650
<b>I'm Amatsuyu Kisaragi. Call me Joro!</b>

13:21.400 --> 13:24.200
<b>I'm Aoi Hinata. Call me Himawari!</b>

13:24.200 --> 13:25.360
<b>Sure!</b>

13:26.320 --> 13:28.070
<b>Nice to meet you, Himawari!</b>

13:28.070 --> 13:29.120
<b>Likewise!</b>

13:29.700 --> 13:31.540
<b><i>That's how Joro and I met.</i></b>

13:32.370 --> 13:35.250
<b><i>I'd met someone who was just like me.</i></b>

13:37.830 --> 13:39.250
<b>- There's Oga!
- Good luck!</b>

13:39.250 --> 13:41.340
<b>- We're counting on you!
- There he is!</b>

13:42.510 --> 13:44.380
<b>The ace is in the house!</b>

13:44.380 --> 13:46.550
<b>Hey, how is everybody?</b>

13:46.550 --> 13:48.590
<b>It's going to be another hot day today.</b>

13:48.590 --> 13:51.430
<b>Make sure you stay hydrated. Don't forget!</b>

13:53.470 --> 13:55.940
<b><i>I guess none of them came.</i></b>

13:55.940 --> 13:59.480
<b>Sun-chan, we'll be fighting with you
from the rooting section!</b>

14:00.020 --> 14:01.610
<b>That's encouraging.</b>

14:02.650 --> 14:05.440
<b><i>As always, "Sun-chan" is a popular guy.</i></b>

14:05.740 --> 14:06.450
<b>Excuse me.</b>

14:07.610 --> 14:09.160
<b>Refreshments for you.</b>

14:09.950 --> 14:11.910
<b>Let's both win here today!</b>

14:12.990 --> 14:15.410
<b>Yeah! We're invincible!</b>

14:19.330 --> 14:20.540
<b>Shiba.</b>

14:21.250 --> 14:23.960
<b>Is something wrong, Oga?</b>

14:23.960 --> 14:25.550
<b>Nah, it's nothing.</b>

14:25.800 --> 14:27.550
<b>All right, let's go!</b>

14:28.840 --> 14:30.180
<b>Play ball!</b>

14:34.720 --> 14:38.850
<b>All right! Before the challenge begins,
let's explain the rules.</b>

14:38.850 --> 14:41.560
<b>It's a complicated challenge,
so let's go through it once more.</b>

14:41.560 --> 14:46.990
<b>Whoever loses can never approach Pansy again
or even talk to her, so these are high stakes!</b>

14:46.990 --> 14:48.740
<b>And now...</b>

14:48.740 --> 14:50.490
<b>...the countdown!</b>

14:52.830 --> 14:55.200
<b>Each girl holding a barrette</b>

14:55.200 --> 14:58.960
<b>gives it to either you or me,
whoever they think "should be with Pansy."</b>

14:58.960 --> 15:02.210
<b>The person who has the most barrettes
at the end is the winner.</b>

15:04.590 --> 15:07.260
<b>At the final game, if Nishikizuta wins,
I get an extra barrette.</b>

15:07.380 --> 15:11.720
<b>If Toshobu wins, Hose gets an extra barrette.</b>

15:14.220 --> 15:17.390
<b>Each girl can only give one barrette to one guy.</b>

15:19.770 --> 15:23.110
<b>Once you've given a barrette,
there are no do-overs.</b>

15:25.020 --> 15:29.400
<b>After the six of us have given our barrettes
and the regional's final game is over,</b>

15:29.400 --> 15:31.320
<b>so is this challenge!</b>

15:33.620 --> 15:37.790
<b>We can only give a barrette
when Joro and Hose are together.</b>

15:40.160 --> 15:43.250
<b>Of course there's no stealing barrettes.</b>

15:45.630 --> 15:48.460
<b>The punishment definitely applies
to whomever loses.</b>

15:48.710 --> 15:52.760
<b>Currently, Hose has three barrettes
and Joro has zero.</b>

15:52.760 --> 15:58.220
<b>If Hose gets just one more barrette, Joro loses!
Joro is in a major pinch!</b>

15:58.220 --> 16:00.810
<b>After all, there are a total of seven barrettes.</b>

16:00.810 --> 16:03.440
<b>But will it end as easily as that?</b>

16:04.230 --> 16:05.270
<b>And so...</b>

16:05.270 --> 16:07.690
<b>please continue to enjoy the show!</b>

16:13.070 --> 16:14.320
<b>Strike!</b>

16:18.660 --> 16:20.080
<b>Hey!</b>

16:20.910 --> 16:22.750
<b>It's already started!</b>

16:22.750 --> 16:24.750
<b>Oh no!</b>

16:24.750 --> 16:27.880
<b>I'm finally freed from selling food!</b>

16:31.550 --> 16:33.050
<b>Found her!</b>

16:37.510 --> 16:39.890
<b>Strike three! Batter out!</b>

16:40.430 --> 16:43.270
<b>H-Hey, Pansy.</b>

16:43.270 --> 16:44.980
<b>Oh, Joro.</b>

16:44.980 --> 16:48.480
<b>Just another day for you, full of trouble.</b>

16:48.480 --> 16:50.440
<b>It'd be nice if you shared my stress.</b>

16:50.440 --> 16:52.530
<b>So what do you want?</b>

16:52.530 --> 16:54.530
<b>Um, well...</b>

16:54.530 --> 16:58.030
<b>Would you give me your barrette?</b>

16:59.290 --> 17:01.290
<b>Tell me, Joro.</b>

17:02.290 --> 17:05.880
<b>What do you think of me?</b>

17:06.500 --> 17:08.750
<b>Wh-What do I think?</b>

17:09.880 --> 17:11.420
<b>I want to know.</b>

17:11.550 --> 17:15.130
<b>W-Well, um...</b>

17:15.800 --> 17:16.760
<b>Time's up.</b>

17:16.760 --> 17:17.890
<b>Time's up?</b>

17:17.890 --> 17:19.100
<b>Look.</b>

17:20.850 --> 17:22.430
<b>Hose!</b>

17:22.680 --> 17:24.350
<b>Crap!</b>

17:25.480 --> 17:26.600
<b>Sorry.</b>

17:27.270 --> 17:29.020
<b>In what sense?</b>

17:30.070 --> 17:32.030
<b>I can't answer you right now.</b>

17:33.940 --> 17:35.030
<b>All right.</b>

17:35.030 --> 17:35.990
<b>See you!</b>

17:39.030 --> 17:40.200
<b>Strike three!</b>

17:40.450 --> 17:41.910
<b>Batter out!</b>

17:44.080 --> 17:45.960
<b>That bastard!</b>

17:46.460 --> 17:47.920
<b>Damn it!</b>

17:47.920 --> 17:50.130
<b>What should I do? Go back?</b>

17:50.130 --> 17:53.840
<b>No, I don't have much time, so...</b>

17:58.390 --> 18:00.100
<b>- What? What is this?
- Sis, where are you!</b>

18:00.100 --> 18:02.060
<b>A lost kid?</b>

18:02.060 --> 18:04.390
<b>Right when I'm busy...</b>

18:04.390 --> 18:07.440
<b>I'm lonely! I'm scared!</b>

18:10.110 --> 18:11.400
<b>What's with this day?</b>

18:15.990 --> 18:17.950
<b>Thank you so much!</b>

18:17.950 --> 18:19.320
<b>It was nothing.</b>

18:19.320 --> 18:20.910
<b>Thank you!</b>

18:20.910 --> 18:21.740
<b>Sure.</b>

18:21.740 --> 18:23.950
<b>- Just don't wander away again, okay?
- Yep!</b>

18:24.040 --> 18:25.410
<b>Now then...</b>

18:26.410 --> 18:29.290
<b>- Don't let go of my hand, okay?
- Sorry, sis.</b>

18:29.290 --> 18:32.210
<b>Taking the time to help a lost girl. I'm so nice!</b>

18:32.550 --> 18:35.840
<b>I imagine Cherry
would give a nice guy like me her barrette.</b>

18:35.840 --> 18:38.010
<b>You're not getting it.</b>

18:40.930 --> 18:43.010
<b>I didn't think so.</b>

18:43.350 --> 18:45.430
<b>So give it up already!</b>

18:45.430 --> 18:48.310
<b>Wait! I have something important to tell you.</b>

18:49.980 --> 18:52.770
<b><i>Calm down! In a way,
this situation is your chance.</i></b>

18:53.070 --> 18:54.360
<b>Something important to tell—</b>

18:54.360 --> 19:00.030
<b>Listen! Even if Hose wins,
he and Pansy will never become a couple!</b>

19:00.610 --> 19:01.990
<b>Huh. How's that?</b>

19:02.370 --> 19:05.910
<b>It's because Pansy doesn't have
those kinds of feelings for him.</b>

19:05.910 --> 19:09.920
<b>In other words, even if Hose wins,
it won't mean anything.</b>

19:09.920 --> 19:12.590
<b>So please give me your barrette!</b>

19:19.470 --> 19:21.510
<b>Don't worry!</b>

19:21.720 --> 19:24.890
<b>He'll have our full support
and we'll get them together no matter what!</b>

19:25.350 --> 19:30.390
<b><i>This girl is a sub-heroine specialist
who's supportive of the main character at all times!</i></b>

19:30.390 --> 19:33.150
<b>So I'll call Hosecchi over.</b>

19:35.480 --> 19:37.190
<b><i>Since it's come to this...</i></b>

19:37.360 --> 19:38.440
<b>Cherry...</b>

19:40.280 --> 19:42.030
<b>Boob brouhaha!</b>

19:45.160 --> 19:48.410
<b>You perverted swine!</b>

19:50.500 --> 19:52.040
<b>My plan worked-oink.</b>

19:53.380 --> 19:54.590
<b>The garbage can...</b>

19:54.590 --> 19:56.880
<b>What are we supposed to do?</b>

19:57.670 --> 19:58.630
<b>Oink!</b>

19:58.800 --> 20:00.970
<b>Oink! Oink!</b>

20:00.970 --> 20:02.970
<b>I'll let you take care of that!</b>

20:03.300 --> 20:04.850
<b>Scoundrel!</b>

20:07.310 --> 20:09.230
<b>Maybe I went too far.</b>

20:09.230 --> 20:12.440
<b>But it was an emergency, so I had no choice.</b>

20:13.730 --> 20:14.860
<b>Sun-chan!</b>

20:14.860 --> 20:16.900
<b>What's wrong? Something on your mind?</b>

20:17.150 --> 20:21.740
<b>Yeah, I wasn't sure
if I should check on the game.</b>

20:23.070 --> 20:24.620
<b>Hi, Joro.</b>

20:26.950 --> 20:30.450
<b>Wow, this has been a tough challenge
because I couldn't find you.</b>

20:30.830 --> 20:34.210
<b>Are you here for something else, too?</b>

20:35.040 --> 20:37.960
<b>I was just talking to Pansy and Cherry.</b>

20:38.210 --> 20:39.460
<b>I see.</b>

20:40.420 --> 20:44.010
<b>Did you ask Sumireko for her barrette?</b>

20:44.010 --> 20:46.390
<b>I can't tell you that.</b>

20:46.390 --> 20:48.220
<b>Well, it doesn't matter.</b>

20:48.220 --> 20:49.310
<b>Excuse me?</b>

20:49.720 --> 20:54.140
<b>I mean, Sumireko just has
the one barrette, right?</b>

20:54.140 --> 20:58.020
<b>In the end, the winner is the person
with the most, so I can afford to give up one.</b>

20:58.860 --> 21:00.320
<b>Well, yeah, but...</b>

21:00.320 --> 21:04.610
<b>More importantly, we're both here now,
so let's get this show on the road.</b>

21:04.990 --> 21:06.620
<b>Oh, shoot!</b>

21:06.620 --> 21:10.080
<b>I'll call everyone... Huh?</b>

21:10.950 --> 21:12.830
<b>I'm not getting any service here.</b>

21:12.830 --> 21:14.670
<b>R-Really?</b>

21:14.670 --> 21:16.000
<b>- Joro.
- Yes?</b>

21:16.250 --> 21:19.340
<b>I'm going to the stands,
and I'll contact them from there.</b>

21:21.170 --> 21:23.470
<b>Service, service...</b>

21:24.010 --> 21:27.340
<b>Wow, talk about opportunity knocking!</b>

21:27.340 --> 21:29.390
<b>Even I get lucky once in a while.</b>

21:30.680 --> 21:32.560
<b>SAKURA AKINO</b>

21:33.560 --> 21:34.020
<b>Hel—</b>

21:34.020 --> 21:37.100
<b><i>Lord Kisaragi! We have an emergency!
A looming emergency!</i></b>

21:37.100 --> 21:41.650
<b><i>I see. She's so nervous playing a part
that she's turned into a samurai?</i></b>

21:37.730 --> 21:41.650
<b><i>Lord Kisaragi? Lord Kisaragi!</i></b>

21:41.940 --> 21:43.070
<b>What is it?</b>

21:43.070 --> 21:45.240
<b><i>Lord Kisaragi, I wish to apprehe...</i></b>

21:47.030 --> 21:49.620
<b><i>This humble servant wishes to aid thee!</i></b>

21:49.620 --> 21:51.870
<b><i>You were going to say "apprehend,"
weren't you?</i></b>

21:51.870 --> 21:55.500
<b>Really? Then let's meet up near gate 5!</b>

21:55.500 --> 21:57.460
<b><i>Great! This way you'll...</i></b>

21:57.460 --> 22:00.380
<b><i>Don't sound so happy about it.
I'm not really going to go.</i></b>

22:00.380 --> 22:02.210
<b><i>Then I shall see thee soon!</i></b>

22:03.920 --> 22:06.380
<b><i>The reception is fine right here.</i></b>

22:07.010 --> 22:08.760
<b>Anyway, right now...</b>

22:11.890 --> 22:14.890
<b>I lost my house key!</b>

22:15.600 --> 22:16.350
<b>Your key?</b>

22:16.350 --> 22:17.730
<b>Can somebody...</b>

22:17.730 --> 22:19.560
<b>Somebody, um...</b>

22:20.110 --> 22:22.530
<b>If you have any sympathy, give me my key!</b>

22:23.070 --> 22:25.240
<b>This day sucks!</b>

22:25.240 --> 22:26.900
<b>If you have any sympathy...</b>

22:26.900 --> 22:28.360
<b>NISHIKIZUTA
TOSHOBU</b>

22:28.820 --> 22:30.070
<b>You did it!</b>

22:30.070 --> 22:31.490
<b>Our first hit!</b>

22:31.490 --> 22:33.660
<b>This is our chance!</b>

22:34.500 --> 22:38.670
<b>We still only have one out!
Come on, time for the cleanup hitter!</b>

22:42.170 --> 22:46.550
<b><i>I can't hear that annoying voice
I'm used to hearing.</i></b>

22:46.880 --> 22:50.970
<b><i>Well, he's in the middle of some dumb challenge,
so he's got his hands full.</i></b>

22:52.140 --> 22:54.930
<b>I'm me and he's him.</b>

22:55.720 --> 22:57.310
<b>I'm counting on you, Shiba.</b>

22:59.650 --> 23:00.940
<b>Strike!</b>

23:01.440 --> 23:04.320
<b>Another full swing as you try to hit a home run?</b>

23:06.990 --> 23:09.740
<b>Oh no. He knows what you're going for.</b>

23:13.080 --> 23:14.240
<b>Shiba!</b>

23:17.200 --> 23:17.830
<b>You're out!</b>

23:18.790 --> 23:20.170
<b>Out!</b>

23:21.670 --> 23:23.880
<b>We've got the field again!</b>

23:24.380 --> 23:26.840
<b><i>Why did he go after that obvious bad pitch?</i></b>

23:28.010 --> 23:28.800
<b>What?</b>

23:29.430 --> 23:31.300
<b>Don't worry about it, Shiba.</b>

23:37.310 --> 23:39.690
<b><i>We're not good enough, huh?</i></b>

23:40.310 --> 23:42.690
<b>The key to my house's safe!</b>

23:42.940 --> 23:44.150
<b>Safe?</b>

23:44.150 --> 23:45.570
<b>I'm glad we found it.</b>

23:45.570 --> 23:49.990
<b>Thank you! Now I won't go hungry anymore!</b>

23:50.990 --> 23:51.950
<b>Sasanqua.</b>

23:51.950 --> 23:53.450
<b>Wh-What?</b>

23:53.740 --> 23:56.990
<b>Thanks for looking with me.
You were a big help.</b>

23:56.990 --> 24:01.290
<b>I-I didn't do it for your sake.
Wait, what are you making me say?</b>

24:01.500 --> 24:03.250
<b><i>You're just saying things on your own!</i></b>

24:03.540 --> 24:06.550
<b>You owe me a reward for this. Got it?</b>

24:06.550 --> 24:09.510
<b>Reward? Y-Yes, of course.</b>

24:10.220 --> 24:12.640
<b>Y... Yay!</b>

24:12.640 --> 24:14.220
<b>Excellent!</b>

24:15.600 --> 24:16.970
<b>- W-Well...
- Yes?</b>

24:17.310 --> 24:19.640
<b>I'm going back to the rooting section.</b>

24:19.640 --> 24:20.730
<b>Okay.</b>

24:21.640 --> 24:23.060
<b>Good for you!</b>

24:23.060 --> 24:25.270
<b>Uh, see you later!</b>

24:25.520 --> 24:27.650
<b>- That went well!
- We're rooting for you!</b>

24:28.730 --> 24:33.160
<b>Well, how kind am I,
to help a girl who lost her key?</b>

24:33.160 --> 24:36.910
<b>I imagine Tsukimi would reward me
with her barrette for being so kind.</b>

24:36.910 --> 24:38.330
<b>I'm not giving it to you.</b>

24:39.080 --> 24:40.580
<b>No chance.</b>

24:41.660 --> 24:43.750
<b><i>Seriously, what's with them?</i></b>

24:44.080 --> 24:46.710
<b>Since I found you, I'm going to call Hose.</b>

24:47.710 --> 24:48.710
<b><i>This feeling!</i></b>

24:48.880 --> 24:50.630
<b><i>Oh, no!</i></b>

24:50.630 --> 24:52.170
<b>We got Joro!</b>

24:52.170 --> 24:54.090
<b>You can't escape now!</b>

24:55.340 --> 24:58.100
<b><i>Making matters worse,
the airheads have me anchored!</i></b>

24:58.390 --> 25:00.520
<b>H-Hey, Tsukimi.</b>

25:00.520 --> 25:01.600
<b>What?</b>

25:01.600 --> 25:06.360
<b>If you help me here,
I'll try to help you get with Hose.</b>

25:06.360 --> 25:07.440
<b>No thanks.</b>

25:07.440 --> 25:09.440
<b>I don't like that kind of thing.</b>

25:09.440 --> 25:15.450
<b><i>Damn it. Can't this sub-heroine specialist
act out of her own self-interest for once?</i></b>

25:15.780 --> 25:18.660
<b>I'm going to help Hose.
I won't give you my barrette.</b>

25:20.040 --> 25:23.040
<b><i>I won't give up.
I have to do something before he gets here!</i></b>

25:23.040 --> 25:24.120
<b>Hey there.</b>

25:25.920 --> 25:26.880
<b>Short time no see!</b>

25:26.880 --> 25:28.250
<b><i>He's here!</i></b>

25:28.250 --> 25:31.670
<b>Joro, the two of you are here.</b>

25:32.340 --> 25:34.090
<b>Then it's showtime!</b>

25:35.550 --> 25:37.720
<b>Worst day ever!</b>

25:38.930 --> 25:40.810
<b>Thank you, everyone.</b>

25:42.730 --> 25:43.770
<b>Well, Joro...</b>

25:45.440 --> 25:47.230
<b>Why don't we talk, just you and me?</b>

25:47.690 --> 25:49.060
<b>Before the final judgment.</b>

25:50.940 --> 25:52.940
<b>NISHIKIZUTA
TOSHOBU</b>

26:05.160 --> 26:07.460
<b>Finally the turnaround point.</b>

26:08.790 --> 26:13.920
<b><i>Ever since middle school started, I had a blast.</i></b>

26:14.420 --> 26:20.100
<b><i>There are various reasons,
but the biggest one was Joro.</i></b>

26:20.850 --> 26:23.060
<b><i>Every day was so much fun.</i></b>

26:24.060 --> 26:26.060
<b><i>That's why I didn't realize it.</i></b>

26:27.060 --> 26:29.520
<b><i>I didn't realize my big mistake.</i></b>

26:30.060 --> 26:33.190
<b>I actually hate Oga.</b>

26:33.320 --> 26:37.660
<b>Why, Shiba? You've been pitcher and catcher
together since elementary school.</b>

26:37.910 --> 26:41.870
<b>After all, he became a starter
right after beginning middle school.</b>

26:42.240 --> 26:45.620
<b>Meanwhile, I finally made it after two years.</b>

26:45.620 --> 26:47.040
<b>Shiba.</b>

26:47.460 --> 26:49.750
<b>It was the same thing in elementary school.</b>

26:49.920 --> 26:51.790
<b>He was the coach's favorite in no time.</b>

26:52.040 --> 26:54.760
<b>Yeah, but isn't that inevitable,
given how good he is?</b>

26:55.670 --> 26:59.010
<b>His ability? Yeah, that may be part of it, but...</b>

27:00.470 --> 27:03.220
<b>He's good at brown-nosing.</b>

27:05.680 --> 27:08.480
<b>Hey bastard, what did you just say?</b>

27:11.270 --> 27:13.940
<b><i>When that happened, I was shocked.</i></b>

27:14.070 --> 27:21.620
<b><i>Doesn't that make sense? He was just like me,
hiding his true self so people would like him.</i></b>

27:21.620 --> 27:22.950
<b><i>Yet he confronted Shiba.</i></b>

27:23.200 --> 27:25.290
<b>What? It's none of your business.</b>

27:25.290 --> 27:28.160
<b>Take back what you said a minute ago.</b>

27:28.960 --> 27:31.170
<b>A minute ago? What are you talking about?</b>

27:31.670 --> 27:33.590
<b>Brown-nosing?</b>

27:33.590 --> 27:35.250
<b>You're wrong.</b>

27:35.250 --> 27:38.880
<b>Sun-chan just wants to get better
at baseball and that's all.</b>

27:39.470 --> 27:43.640
<b>So much that he asked an upperclassman
to stay after practice and help him train!</b>

27:45.100 --> 27:47.890
<b>Just another example of Oga
getting special treatment!</b>

27:47.890 --> 27:49.480
<b>That's why I hate him.</b>

27:49.480 --> 27:52.270
<b>He didn't ask you to train with him?</b>

27:52.560 --> 27:54.400
<b>W-Well...</b>

27:55.650 --> 28:00.950
<b>I don't forgive anyone who runs their mouth off
with lies designed to sabotage my best friend!</b>

28:00.950 --> 28:03.410
<b>So take it back!</b>

28:03.410 --> 28:05.370
<b>A-All right! I take it back!</b>

28:05.830 --> 28:07.080
<b>Then we're good.</b>

28:07.240 --> 28:09.460
<b>H-Hey, let's go.</b>

28:09.460 --> 28:10.660
<b>Yeah.</b>

28:16.590 --> 28:17.960
<b>I was so scared.</b>

28:19.090 --> 28:21.510
<b>I said too much again.</b>

28:21.510 --> 28:24.180
<b>This is why I hate this version of me.</b>

28:26.390 --> 28:27.930
<b>I was wrong.</b>

28:29.140 --> 28:31.600
<b>He isn't like me.</b>

28:32.560 --> 28:34.900
<b><i>He wasn't doing it so people would like him.</i></b>

28:35.270 --> 28:38.610
<b><i>He kept his true self hidden so he could protect
those who were closest to him.</i></b>

28:39.280 --> 28:41.740
<b><i>That's the kind of man Joro is.</i></b>

28:48.370 --> 28:52.670
<b><i>He thinks judgment is at hand,
but only gave me a perfect opportunity.</i></b>

28:52.670 --> 28:55.380
<b><i>I'll wait for my chance
and then make a break for it!</i></b>

28:56.130 --> 28:58.800
<b>So what did you want to talk about?</b>

28:58.800 --> 29:01.970
<b>Actually, I'd like to make a slight adjustment
to the punishment part.</b>

29:05.140 --> 29:07.680
<b>Make an adjustment?</b>

29:07.970 --> 29:11.890
<b><i>Number four, third baseman, Tokusho.</i></b>

29:20.110 --> 29:21.940
<b><i>I'm not Joro.</i></b>

29:26.240 --> 29:28.280
<b><i>I can't become Joro!</i></b>

29:32.410 --> 29:33.040
<b>Right!</b>

29:34.790 --> 29:35.880
<b>- Go!
- We can get a run!</b>

29:37.420 --> 29:39.090
<b>Don't intercept it!</b>

29:46.720 --> 29:47.680
<b>Out!</b>

29:48.390 --> 29:50.680
<b>Shiba, you...</b>

29:53.890 --> 29:55.940
<b>Make an adjustment?</b>

29:56.980 --> 29:58.270
<b>In what way?</b>

29:58.440 --> 30:04.610
<b>Well, right now, the loser
can't approach or talk to Sumireko.</b>

30:04.610 --> 30:05.860
<b>But I want to add...</b>

30:05.860 --> 30:10.410
<b>The loser can't approach or talk
to any of Sumireko's friends either.</b>

30:12.080 --> 30:15.870
<b>I want you to lose everything.</b>

30:17.370 --> 30:18.580
<b>Hey...</b>

30:19.920 --> 30:20.790
<b>What's wrong?</b>

30:21.460 --> 30:24.420
<b>Who the hell are you?</b>

30:24.800 --> 30:27.510
<b>I'm Hazuki. Yasuo Hazuki.</b>

30:27.800 --> 30:29.890
<b>Your former friend and now...</b>

30:29.890 --> 30:35.060
<b>I'm the man who is trying to expunge
every trace of you from within Sumireko.</b>

30:36.850 --> 30:38.560
<b>I've been thinking about it for a while now.</b>

30:38.850 --> 30:42.860
<b>What you said and what it really means.</b>

30:42.980 --> 30:44.530
<b>Then I finally understood.</b>

30:45.030 --> 30:47.400
<b>Wait, you mean...</b>

30:47.700 --> 30:53.120
<b>There are feelings you show on the surface
and then the other ones you have.</b>

30:53.870 --> 30:55.830
<b><i>He realized?</i></b>

30:56.250 --> 30:59.580
<b><i>That he's the protagonist
of the romantic comedy.</i></b>

31:00.500 --> 31:02.460
<b>I know everything.</b>

31:02.800 --> 31:05.670
<b>The feelings of the girls around me.</b>

31:05.970 --> 31:09.800
<b>And Sumireko's true feelings, too.</b>

31:10.260 --> 31:12.760
<b><i>He already has a firm grasp of everything.</i></b>

31:14.100 --> 31:15.980
<b><i>Even the feelings under the surface.</i></b>

31:16.350 --> 31:20.440
<b>That's why I'm going to eradicate you, Joro.</b>

31:20.440 --> 31:22.860
<b>The you that takes up space
in Sumireko's heart.</b>

31:23.360 --> 31:26.030
<b>That's why I'm going to fine-tune
the punishment.</b>

31:26.360 --> 31:28.110
<b>It's my final decision.</b>

31:28.450 --> 31:31.070
<b>Fine with me. Let's go with it.</b>

31:31.570 --> 31:33.780
<b>You seem very confident.</b>

31:33.950 --> 31:35.330
<b>Yeah, well...</b>

31:35.330 --> 31:40.290
<b>It looks like you've underestimated our bond.</b>

31:40.750 --> 31:43.210
<b>You're about to lose that bond.</b>

31:43.500 --> 31:46.420
<b>No, I won't. Not until the day I die.</b>

31:46.800 --> 31:48.880
<b>Then why don't we pull the trigger and see?</b>

31:48.880 --> 31:52.470
<b>It's time for the hammy background actor
to shuffle off the stage.</b>

31:54.180 --> 31:54.930
<b>NISHIKIZUTA
TOSHOBU</b>

31:58.480 --> 32:00.690
<b><i>I can only throw for one more inning.</i></b>

32:00.850 --> 32:02.610
<b><i>If we go into extra innings...</i></b>

32:07.860 --> 32:09.650
<b>Empty...</b>

32:11.030 --> 32:18.290
<b><i>After I found out about the true Joro,
I had mixed feelings, but I was still happy.</i></b>

32:19.830 --> 32:22.080
<b>It's tough studying for entrance exams.</b>

32:22.540 --> 32:24.290
<b>Thanks for helping me out again.</b>

32:24.630 --> 32:26.880
<b>Not at all. I don't mind.</b>

32:27.210 --> 32:32.640
<b><i>She seemed like an innocent, sweet girl.
I was in love with her.</i></b>

32:33.390 --> 32:37.810
<b>I wonder if we'll be able to study
with Joro and Himawari too tomorrow.</b>

32:37.970 --> 32:42.520
<b>Probably. Today those two
just happened to have other plans.</b>

32:43.560 --> 32:44.520
<b>I see.</b>

32:52.030 --> 32:54.450
<b>- L-Listen—
- H-Hey.</b>

32:55.700 --> 32:59.540
<b>Oga, I want to talk to you about something.</b>

33:00.330 --> 33:01.960
<b>If it's okay?</b>

33:02.290 --> 33:03.250
<b>What's up?</b>

33:04.880 --> 33:06.250
<b>Um...</b>

33:11.260 --> 33:14.430
<b>First, would you sit next to me?</b>

33:14.720 --> 33:17.350
<b>Y-Yeah. Sure.</b>

33:21.310 --> 33:24.730
<b>A-Actually, um...</b>

33:25.020 --> 33:28.400
<b>There's someone I like.</b>

33:28.400 --> 33:29.480
<b>Someone you like?</b>

33:29.900 --> 33:34.280
<b>When I think about him, my chest feels tight.</b>

33:34.280 --> 33:38.120
<b>But even just getting to see him
every day makes me happy.</b>

33:41.910 --> 33:43.250
<b>You see, I...</b>

33:53.220 --> 33:56.140
<b>I'm in love with your best friend, Joro.</b>

34:06.270 --> 34:09.650
<b>This is our big chance!</b>

34:11.730 --> 34:12.690
<b>Shiba.</b>

34:13.940 --> 34:15.150
<b>Strike!</b>

34:15.450 --> 34:17.410
<b>Trying to hit a homer again?</b>

34:18.700 --> 34:19.910
<b>Strike two!</b>

34:21.240 --> 34:24.460
<b><i>It's okay. Baseball is about teamwork.</i></b>

34:24.460 --> 34:26.540
<b><i>If Shiba can't do it, I'll take a crack.</i></b>

34:28.670 --> 34:29.500
<b>Ball!</b>

34:36.430 --> 34:37.590
<b>Is he...</b>

34:38.590 --> 34:40.100
<b><i>Hey, Joro.</i></b>

34:40.970 --> 34:45.140
<b><i>Bottom of the ninth, one out, a man on third.
The score is tied.</i></b>

34:45.140 --> 34:47.310
<b><i>One run in, and we win.</i></b>

34:47.310 --> 34:51.940
<b><i>At a time like that,
what do you think the batter should do?</i></b>

34:55.610 --> 34:56.400
<b>Safe!</b>

34:56.400 --> 34:57.280
<b>First!</b>

34:58.110 --> 34:58.820
<b>Out!</b>

35:00.410 --> 35:01.990
<b>A squeeze bunt...</b>

35:01.990 --> 35:04.080
<b>Shiba bunted,</b>

35:04.750 --> 35:06.460
<b>and we scored a run.</b>

35:07.790 --> 35:09.920
<b>Is that what he's been going for all along?</b>

35:10.330 --> 35:12.630
<b>Was he taking a series of full swings
on purpose?</b>

35:14.460 --> 35:16.260
<b>I can finally see it!</b>

35:16.260 --> 35:21.890
<b>The day I make my debut as an executive,
charismatic, international, galactic, extreme idol!</b>

35:22.140 --> 35:24.560
<b>And so, Oga!</b>

35:25.310 --> 35:28.230
<b>Please use this for our final defense!</b>

35:30.520 --> 35:31.730
<b>This is...</b>

35:32.820 --> 35:38.990
<b>That hat is imbued with the world's biggest desire
for you to win, Oga.</b>

35:39.200 --> 35:41.490
<b>O-Oh. Thank you.</b>

35:43.700 --> 35:46.080
<b>L-Listen, Shiba...</b>

35:46.660 --> 35:48.580
<b>That bunt saved us.</b>

35:48.580 --> 35:51.630
<b>As expected... from my partner.</b>

35:53.840 --> 35:55.340
<b>Wh-What?</b>

35:56.880 --> 35:58.670
<b>I'm giving this back to you.</b>

36:01.220 --> 36:02.760
<b>This is...</b>

36:03.050 --> 36:06.060
<b>I've been jealous of you all these years, Oga.</b>

36:06.850 --> 36:10.690
<b>I was envious. Because everyone relied on you.</b>

36:11.980 --> 36:14.940
<b>I... wanted to be you, Oga.</b>

36:17.690 --> 36:20.780
<b>But I didn't have it in me.</b>

36:20.780 --> 36:24.660
<b>That was so frustrating and yet,
I still wanted to win badly.</b>

36:25.950 --> 36:28.450
<b>So badly that I made the mistake
of choosing dirty tricks.</b>

36:28.910 --> 36:30.750
<b>I'm sorry, for all these years!</b>

36:31.500 --> 36:32.670
<b>You don't have to apologize.</b>

36:34.840 --> 36:37.380
<b>I'm the same.</b>

36:38.300 --> 36:40.170
<b>I admired this one guy.</b>

36:40.630 --> 36:43.090
<b>I wanted to beat him
and didn't care how I had to do it.</b>

36:43.550 --> 36:47.470
<b>So I made the mistake
of going with dirty tricks, too.</b>

36:47.970 --> 36:51.520
<b>But no matter what I did, I didn't win.</b>

36:52.060 --> 36:53.400
<b>CHALLENGE</b>

36:52.060 --> 36:56.110
<b>Every time, he would make me realize
the vast gulf between our strengths.</b>

36:56.900 --> 36:58.690
<b>I wanted to get close to that level.</b>

36:58.900 --> 37:00.530
<b>I wanted to become him.</b>

37:01.320 --> 37:02.150
<b>But...</b>

37:03.950 --> 37:06.660
<b>I can't be anyone but myself.</b>

37:08.040 --> 37:09.290
<b>Oga...</b>

37:11.250 --> 37:14.790
<b>So your Joro was me, huh?</b>

37:15.750 --> 37:17.460
<b>All right, bottom of the ninth!</b>

37:17.460 --> 37:18.630
<b>You and me...</b>

37:18.630 --> 37:22.090
<b>No, all of us together, let's win this thing!</b>

37:22.680 --> 37:25.090
<b>We can do it, can't we, partner?</b>

37:26.260 --> 37:29.180
<b>You bet, Sun-chan!</b>

37:30.560 --> 37:33.060
<b>Joro, how dare you trick me like that?</b>

37:33.520 --> 37:35.400
<b>But now we're all here.</b>

37:38.400 --> 37:41.570
<b>Sorry, Pansy. The situation has changed a bit.</b>

37:42.400 --> 37:45.570
<b>Sumireko. I'm not the person I was before.</b>

37:45.570 --> 37:47.780
<b>I swear I'll beat Joro here.</b>

37:48.280 --> 37:49.540
<b>Hey, Pansy.</b>

37:50.370 --> 37:54.710
<b>I want you to watch to the very end
and then decide what to do.</b>

37:58.750 --> 37:59.670
<b>Okay.</b>

38:00.210 --> 38:02.590
<b>Well, let's get this over with.</b>

38:02.590 --> 38:03.720
<b>Right, Tsukimicchi?</b>

38:04.930 --> 38:05.800
<b>Yeah.</b>

38:08.640 --> 38:10.140
<b>Before that...</b>

38:10.510 --> 38:11.640
<b>Joro.</b>

38:12.270 --> 38:15.600
<b>Before you make your decision,
let's have a warm-up match.</b>

38:20.440 --> 38:23.110
<b>What are you doing, Cosmoscchi?</b>

38:23.110 --> 38:25.950
<b>Right now, you're a nuisance.</b>

38:26.160 --> 38:28.070
<b>Move, Himawari.</b>

38:29.030 --> 38:30.530
<b>You can't do the opposite!</b>

38:33.290 --> 38:35.500
<b>The opposite? What do you mean?</b>

38:35.830 --> 38:37.750
<b>Cherry, Tsukimi.</b>

38:37.750 --> 38:42.460
<b>Don't use Pansy to make yourselves give up
on your own love.</b>

38:44.130 --> 38:48.970
<b>I'm sorry. To be honest,
I realized that when we talked at the cafe.</b>

38:48.970 --> 38:50.720
<b>We were the same way.</b>

38:51.010 --> 38:52.970
<b>S-Same?</b>

38:53.930 --> 38:57.650
<b>Before, we were in love with someone else.</b>

38:58.060 --> 39:03.900
<b>Then he asked us to help him succeed
in getting together with Pansy.</b>

39:04.280 --> 39:07.910
<b>I didn't want him to hate me, so I helped.</b>

39:09.070 --> 39:10.370
<b>Both of you?</b>

39:10.830 --> 39:13.160
<b>I'm ashamed of myself then.</b>

39:13.740 --> 39:15.660
<b>That's how I figured it out.</b>

39:16.410 --> 39:22.040
<b>You two were lying about your own feelings
and acting so the person you love wouldn't hate you.</b>

39:22.340 --> 39:24.550
<b>We're not lying.</b>

39:25.090 --> 39:28.680
<b>The truth is you don't want him to win,
but you're trying to help him win, right?</b>

39:30.180 --> 39:31.140
<b>No...</b>

39:31.510 --> 39:34.390
<b>Then why did you ask for help?</b>

39:37.520 --> 39:39.310
<b><i>Joro. Please help.</i></b>

39:39.770 --> 39:44.190
<b>You wanted an excuse so you could completely
give up on your feelings, didn't you?</b>

39:47.950 --> 39:49.860
<b>You saw right through us?</b>

39:50.160 --> 39:52.620
<b>That's right. Exactly!</b>

39:53.410 --> 39:55.370
<b>It's all your fault!</b>

39:55.580 --> 39:59.540
<b>If it hadn't been for you,
we would've always been able to...</b>

40:03.000 --> 40:06.840
<b>But I have to apologize to Jorocchi.</b>

40:07.170 --> 40:08.550
<b>M-Me?</b>

40:08.720 --> 40:14.060
<b>Sorry. That first time we met,
I'm the one who beat up that book.</b>

40:15.100 --> 40:17.060
<b>But we were looking for it together.</b>

40:17.060 --> 40:21.560
<b>We were, but before we started
looking for it together, I spotted it.</b>

40:21.560 --> 40:24.520
<b>I recognized the book and...</b>

40:26.190 --> 40:29.450
<b>Why did he choose you and not us?</b>

40:29.860 --> 40:32.200
<b>It's unforgivable. It's not fair.</b>

40:35.200 --> 40:36.870
<b>Himawari?</b>

40:36.870 --> 40:37.870
<b>You're wrong.</b>

40:38.250 --> 40:40.290
<b>At first, that's what I thought, too.</b>

40:40.290 --> 40:42.080
<b>That Pansy wasn't playing fair.</b>

40:42.460 --> 40:45.380
<b>But that was my mistake.
Pansy didn't do anything wrong!</b>

40:45.380 --> 40:48.380
<b>It's my own fault!
Because I didn't tell him how I felt!</b>

40:48.760 --> 40:50.260
<b>Just a little bit.</b>

40:50.260 --> 40:53.890
<b>Just muster a little bit of courage.
That's all I ask.</b>

40:56.220 --> 41:01.100
<b>It's okay. If you put your feelings
in your words, they'll get right through.</b>

41:01.440 --> 41:06.570
<b>That's right. Whatever happens,
I have no intention of leaving his side.</b>

41:07.780 --> 41:10.030
<b>Joro and I will always be buddies!</b>

41:10.280 --> 41:11.900
<b>Please look at me.</b>

41:11.900 --> 41:15.160
<b>See? Even now, I can be with him like this.</b>

41:16.370 --> 41:21.120
<b>Jeez, all three of you
are more vicious than Sumirekocchi.</b>

41:21.580 --> 41:23.750
<b>But you're right.</b>

41:24.170 --> 41:28.840
<b>Hey, Hosecchi. Will you listen to us for a bit?</b>

41:29.340 --> 41:32.430
<b>Please listen to how I feel.</b>

41:32.630 --> 41:33.590
<b>Sure.</b>

41:36.390 --> 41:39.390
<b>I love you, Hose.</b>

41:39.390 --> 41:42.480
<b>So I want to be your girlfriend!</b>

41:42.850 --> 41:46.150
<b>I... love you, Hose.</b>

41:46.310 --> 41:49.190
<b>Let me be by your side more than anyone.</b>

41:51.860 --> 41:54.360
<b>I'm sorry. I can't agree to either wish.</b>

41:54.740 --> 41:56.820
<b>Yeah. I knew that.</b>

41:59.660 --> 42:01.660
<b>I feel refreshed!</b>

42:01.870 --> 42:05.960
<b>Now, can we get back
to the passing of the barrettes, huh?</b>

42:05.960 --> 42:07.080
<b>Tsukimicchi.</b>

42:07.250 --> 42:08.170
<b>Yeah.</b>

42:12.090 --> 42:13.380
<b>Jorocchi.</b>

42:13.380 --> 42:15.130
<b>I'm giving you mine.</b>

42:15.340 --> 42:16.590
<b>For my own sake.</b>

42:18.510 --> 42:19.720
<b>Are you sure?</b>

42:19.720 --> 42:20.640
<b>Yeah.</b>

42:21.520 --> 42:23.060
<b>Thank you.</b>

42:23.390 --> 42:27.560
<b>I don't want Hose to be sad.</b>

42:28.150 --> 42:31.030
<b>Thank you, Tsukimi.</b>

42:31.780 --> 42:37.160
<b>Out of the seven barrettes,
Hose has four and I have one.</b>

42:38.780 --> 42:40.530
<b>Joro, that clinches—</b>

42:40.530 --> 42:41.910
<b>Not yet.</b>

42:42.410 --> 42:44.040
<b>That was the warm-up.</b>

42:44.040 --> 42:47.630
<b>Now it's time to show my real strategy.</b>

42:47.920 --> 42:50.340
<b>What are you talking about, Joro?</b>

42:50.920 --> 42:53.210
<b>Hi. Sorry I took so long, Joro.</b>

42:53.210 --> 42:56.720
<b>Tsubaki! What are you doing here?
I thought you had to work today.</b>

42:56.880 --> 43:01.430
<b>I had someone switch with me for a little bit.
So I could support Joro here.</b>

43:01.680 --> 43:03.060
<b>Here you go.</b>

43:04.520 --> 43:07.140
<b>W-Wait, what?</b>

43:07.140 --> 43:08.770
<b>Certainly, the rules state...</b>

43:09.900 --> 43:11.440
<b>That's right.</b>

43:11.770 --> 43:13.650
<b>So that's what it is.</b>

43:13.940 --> 43:19.870
<b>There's no rule that states
I can only accept barrettes from you six.</b>

43:19.870 --> 43:25.040
<b>In other words, as long as there's a woman
with a barrette, it's fair game.</b>

43:25.040 --> 43:26.910
<b>Oh, I see!</b>

43:27.830 --> 43:29.210
<b>You're sneaky, Joro!</b>

43:29.500 --> 43:32.170
<b>So you planned that from the beginning.</b>

43:32.420 --> 43:37.130
<b>That's right. I didn't just try to convince
Cherry and Tsukimi.</b>

43:37.800 --> 43:44.720
<b>I made my pitch to other girls too,
asking them to come right here and now!</b>

43:45.470 --> 43:48.270
<b>Sorry we're late!</b>

43:48.480 --> 43:50.980
<b>Short time no see, Kisaragi!</b>

43:51.110 --> 43:53.690
<b>Thanks for waiting for me!</b>

43:53.940 --> 43:55.650
<b>Here you go!</b>

43:55.990 --> 43:59.740
<b>Hose, this brings my total to five,
and you have four.</b>

43:59.740 --> 44:01.370
<b>I turned the tables on you, huh?</b>

44:01.660 --> 44:04.620
<b>Well, I have to get back to work.</b>

44:04.620 --> 44:06.330
<b>See you later, Joro.</b>

44:06.580 --> 44:08.460
<b>Yep. You're a lifesaver, Tsubaki.</b>

44:09.790 --> 44:10.790
<b>Come on, Sasanqua!</b>

44:10.790 --> 44:12.170
<b>D-Don't push me!</b>

44:12.170 --> 44:14.250
<b>I don't have to be the one standing in front!</b>

44:14.250 --> 44:16.130
<b>After everything, what are you talking about?</b>

44:16.460 --> 44:19.840
<b>Sorry for the hassle, Sasanqua.
I appreciate you coming though.</b>

44:21.260 --> 44:25.600
<b>It's no big deal!
I just feel like giving away my barrette today.</b>

44:25.600 --> 44:29.600
<b>So you'd better not get the wrong idea.
It was just for convenience, that's all!</b>

44:29.770 --> 44:32.060
<b>- Here you go.
- Good luck!</b>

44:30.100 --> 44:32.060
<b><i>Convenient for what?</i></b>

44:32.230 --> 44:35.610
<b>Well, we're going back, so do your best.</b>

44:35.610 --> 44:37.150
<b>Y-Yeah.</b>

44:37.150 --> 44:39.530
<b>- You did it!
- That's one step forward!</b>

44:41.950 --> 44:43.530
<b>That makes ten.</b>

44:43.530 --> 44:46.830
<b>You're not going to accuse me
of breaking the rules, are you?</b>

44:47.160 --> 44:48.660
<b>No, I won't accuse you.</b>

44:49.580 --> 44:51.710
<b>Then the winner is...</b>

44:51.960 --> 44:55.500
<b>D-Did you ask any other girls to come over?</b>

44:55.750 --> 44:58.210
<b>No, that was all of them.</b>

44:59.880 --> 45:01.430
<b>I see.</b>

45:07.350 --> 45:12.440
<b>You should've called for this showdown
the first time I saw you today.</b>

45:13.270 --> 45:17.900
<b>You realized, didn't you?
That I let you get away on purpose then.</b>

45:19.190 --> 45:23.160
<b>My purpose was to uncover
what you were thinking.</b>

45:23.160 --> 45:27.830
<b>That's why I asked you,
"Are you here for something else, too?"</b>

45:28.910 --> 45:32.750
<b>I wondered why you didn't tell me
about helping the little lost girl.</b>

45:34.250 --> 45:36.880
<b>That clued me in to your strategy.</b>

45:37.130 --> 45:40.670
<b>That's why I was inwardly desperate
to escape from you.</b>

45:43.930 --> 45:47.560
<b>It was extremely frustrating. However...</b>

45:49.020 --> 45:52.640
<b>- Something about a barrette?
- Oh, there he is.</b>

45:52.980 --> 45:54.850
<b>N-No way.</b>

45:55.600 --> 45:58.730
<b>Hi, everyone. Thank you for coming.</b>

45:59.940 --> 46:02.400
<b>Of course we're happy to help you, Hose!</b>

46:02.400 --> 46:03.950
<b>So without further ado...</b>

46:08.450 --> 46:11.830
<b>Well, Hose, I don't know
what this is about, but good luck!</b>

46:12.330 --> 46:14.790
<b>Thank you! You were all a big help!</b>

46:20.880 --> 46:23.090
<b>I have a total of 98.</b>

46:23.470 --> 46:27.140
<b>This is the difference
between the main character and the extra.</b>

46:28.430 --> 46:31.600
<b>So what are you going to do?
Any more desperate ploys?</b>

46:34.980 --> 46:37.270
<b>No. Enough.</b>

46:40.360 --> 46:43.070
<b>I lost.</b>

46:44.490 --> 46:48.570
<b>Then why don't we tell them
about the punishment revision?</b>

46:49.450 --> 46:55.500
<b>It changed to "never approaching or talking
to Sumireko or any of her friends."</b>

46:56.330 --> 47:00.500
<b>Hence, if Joro loses,
all of you will be out of his life.</b>

47:00.500 --> 47:04.340
<b>Then I'll give Joro a barrette, too!
I'll give him a lot! Then—</b>

47:04.550 --> 47:07.220
<b>Each person can only give one barrette.</b>

47:07.390 --> 47:09.350
<b>One girl can't give lots of them.</b>

47:10.180 --> 47:12.560
<b>Th-Then I'll change the person
I gave my barrette to—</b>

47:12.720 --> 47:15.890
<b>Once you've give a barrette,
there are no do-overs.</b>

47:15.890 --> 47:17.560
<b>You can't change that rule now.</b>

47:18.400 --> 47:19.730
<b>You're playing dirty, Hose!</b>

47:20.060 --> 47:24.650
<b>Don't worry. There's still a good way
that you can be with Joro.</b>

47:24.860 --> 47:26.740
<b>A good way?</b>

47:28.240 --> 47:30.280
<b>Just stop being Sumireko's friend.</b>

47:31.950 --> 47:33.580
<b>So what'll it be?</b>

47:33.580 --> 47:35.620
<b>That's a no-brainer.</b>

47:35.620 --> 47:38.670
<b>I have no intention
of giving up my friendship with Pansy!</b>

47:38.670 --> 47:39.500
<b>Me either!</b>

47:39.500 --> 47:41.340
<b>I ain't going to stop bein' her friend either!</b>

47:42.420 --> 47:43.550
<b>Everyone...</b>

47:46.050 --> 47:49.930
<b>After the challenge, I look forward to seeing
whether your feelings will stay the same.</b>

47:50.930 --> 47:52.390
<b>Well, let's try this again.</b>

47:53.720 --> 47:57.390
<b>Sumireko, I want you to be my girlfriend.</b>

47:57.390 --> 47:59.770
<b>Stop looking at that background actor.</b>

48:00.020 --> 48:01.520
<b>Look at the main character.</b>

48:01.520 --> 48:03.400
<b>The challenge isn't over.</b>

48:03.400 --> 48:07.490
<b>True. But only your barrette is left.</b>

48:07.860 --> 48:09.570
<b>Once you give that, I—</b>

48:11.530 --> 48:13.780
<b>What's the idea, Joro?</b>

48:14.120 --> 48:15.700
<b>You already lost, remember?</b>

48:15.700 --> 48:18.620
<b>Yeah. I already lost.</b>

48:18.620 --> 48:19.750
<b>But...</b>

48:20.620 --> 48:22.880
<b>We haven't lost yet.</b>

48:22.880 --> 48:24.880
<b>Hey! Sorry I'm late.</b>

48:25.210 --> 48:26.380
<b>Joro!</b>

48:26.630 --> 48:27.590
<b>Y-You...</b>

48:28.260 --> 48:29.800
<b>I've been waiting for you, Sun-chan.</b>

48:32.930 --> 48:35.600
<b>The headliner is here!</b>

48:35.770 --> 48:37.560
<b>What? Tampopocchi?</b>

48:38.020 --> 48:41.100
<b>Long time no see, Sakurabara and Kusami!</b>

48:41.350 --> 48:45.610
<b>But I don't have time
to get involved with you two right now.</b>

48:46.070 --> 48:48.570
<b>Here you go, Kisaragi!</b>

48:48.570 --> 48:50.030
<b>Oh, thank you.</b>

48:50.030 --> 48:52.450
<b>Tampopo, what are you doing?</b>

48:54.530 --> 48:59.210
<b>Hazuki, I'm just doing something
so I could become happy!</b>

49:00.250 --> 49:02.880
<b>- Hey, is this where we're supposed to go?
- Yeah, I think so.</b>

49:03.040 --> 49:07.840
<b>I asked all the supporters
of the baseball team to help out.</b>

49:08.920 --> 49:10.050
<b>Best friend!</b>

49:10.170 --> 49:11.840
<b>I knew my best friend would come through.</b>

49:11.840 --> 49:17.220
<b>H-How? I've been watching
since Joro came to the ball park!</b>

49:17.220 --> 49:19.060
<b>He never had a chance to speak with Sun-chan!</b>

49:19.640 --> 49:22.690
<b>See, that's where you're wrong, Hose.</b>

49:22.690 --> 49:23.520
<b>I'm wrong?</b>

49:23.520 --> 49:25.900
<b>Think back carefully.</b>

49:25.900 --> 49:27.940
<b>What was I doing at the very beginning?</b>

49:27.940 --> 49:29.280
<b>At the beginning?</b>

49:29.820 --> 49:33.740
<b>Y-You were walking around,
selling chicken skewers...</b>

49:34.700 --> 49:40.160
<b>See, this is why I said
you were underestimating our bond.</b>

49:40.620 --> 49:42.080
<b><i>Refreshments for you.</i></b>

49:42.960 --> 49:44.630
<b><i>Let's both win here today!</i></b>

49:46.000 --> 49:48.420
<b><i>Yeah! We're invincible!</i></b>

49:48.670 --> 49:53.300
<b>Then, at the very end,
I had Pansy buy me some time.</b>

49:53.300 --> 49:55.300
<b>You know why, right?</b>

49:57.100 --> 50:02.230
<b>After the first six girls give away their barrettes
and the game is over, so is the challenge!</b>

50:03.020 --> 50:07.770
<b>Even if the game is over, the challenge isn't
until Pansy gives away her barrette!</b>

50:09.780 --> 50:11.610
<b>You're sneaky, Joro!</b>

50:11.610 --> 50:14.030
<b>You mean... from the very beginning...</b>

50:14.280 --> 50:16.410
<b>All right, I'm counting on everyone!</b>

50:16.410 --> 50:17.780
<b>Okay!</b>

50:18.950 --> 50:25.670
<b>22, 23, 24, 25, 26...</b>

50:25.880 --> 50:30.250
<b>57, 58, 59, 60...</b>

50:30.250 --> 50:34.720
<b>75, 76, 77, 78...</b>

50:34.720 --> 50:39.970
<b>94, 95, 96, 97...</b>

50:40.430 --> 50:41.810
<b>98!</b>

50:42.680 --> 50:44.770
<b>I caught up, Hose.</b>

50:45.520 --> 50:46.980
<b>Joro.</b>

50:47.230 --> 50:48.810
<b>Th-That's right!</b>

50:48.810 --> 50:52.490
<b>How did the game end?
If Toshobu won, I still have a...</b>

50:52.490 --> 50:55.320
<b>Oh, that's right.</b>

50:55.450 --> 50:57.110
<b>The result of the game.</b>

51:02.580 --> 51:04.120
<b>NISHIKIZUTA
TOSHOBU</b>

51:09.460 --> 51:10.920
<b><i>Crap.</i></b>

51:11.050 --> 51:14.380
<b><i>Number four, third baseman, Tokusho.</i></b>

51:15.420 --> 51:16.340
<b>Time out!</b>

51:17.970 --> 51:19.050
<b>What do you want to do?</b>

51:19.470 --> 51:21.600
<b>Tokusho's gotten a hit with every at-bat today.</b>

51:21.600 --> 51:22.720
<b>Intentional walk...</b>

51:23.430 --> 51:24.600
<b>Sun-chan?</b>

51:25.390 --> 51:26.980
<b>Of course, we'll go all out!</b>

51:26.980 --> 51:28.020
<b>Got it.</b>

51:48.920 --> 51:51.500
<b><i>I can't do this. I can't beat him.</i></b>

51:51.710 --> 51:54.340
<b><i>Yes, you can win! You'd better win!</i></b>

52:02.510 --> 52:04.430
<b><i>You realize it, don't you?</i></b>

52:04.430 --> 52:07.270
<b><i>None of them are cheering you on.</i></b>

52:07.270 --> 52:09.900
<b><i>It's because they're all crazy about him.</i></b>

52:10.190 --> 52:12.060
<b><i>Yeah.</i></b>

52:12.900 --> 52:14.360
<b><i>None of them are here.</i></b>

52:14.860 --> 52:16.440
<b><i>None of them.</i></b>

52:16.780 --> 52:18.490
<b><i>The library group...</i></b>

52:19.280 --> 52:21.700
<b><i>Why am I all alone here?</i></b>

52:21.870 --> 52:23.700
<b><i>They're with him.</i></b>

52:28.540 --> 52:31.500
<b>DON'T FORGET THE ROSIN BAG!!</b>

52:29.960 --> 52:31.500
<b><i>Don't forget the rosin bag!</i></b>

52:33.960 --> 52:36.210
<b>This lousy handwriting is...</b>

52:37.550 --> 52:43.220
<b><i>My last pitch for that game,
my control was off a bit.</i></b>

52:43.220 --> 52:45.770
<b><i>If I'd only used my rosin bag then...</i></b>

52:46.180 --> 52:52.360
<b><i>That hat is imbued with the world's biggest desire
for you to win, Oga.</i></b>

52:56.480 --> 52:57.690
<b>I'm...</b>

52:58.360 --> 52:59.280
<b>not going to win.</b>

52:59.570 --> 53:00.950
<b>Let's shut 'em down!</b>

53:02.910 --> 53:04.580
<b><i>Let's shut 'em down.</i></b>

53:04.580 --> 53:06.120
<b><i>Not only me.</i></b>

53:06.290 --> 53:07.790
<b><i>We're going to win together!</i></b>

53:08.290 --> 53:09.710
<b><i>I mean, of course.</i></b>

53:09.710 --> 53:11.500
<b><i>Trust and effort.</i></b>

53:11.670 --> 53:14.210
<b><i>Believe in what you and your friends
have done all this time</i></b>

53:14.790 --> 53:17.420
<b><i>and never run away,
but give it everything you've got!</i></b>

53:18.170 --> 53:19.510
<b><i>That's...</i></b>

53:19.510 --> 53:20.930
<b><i>Sun-chan!</i></b>

53:23.550 --> 53:24.680
<b>Cover!</b>

53:26.260 --> 53:27.140
<b>Sun-chan!</b>

53:27.140 --> 53:27.850
<b>C'mere!</b>

53:35.400 --> 53:36.440
<b>Out!</b>

53:37.070 --> 53:38.900
<b>That's the game!</b>

53:46.280 --> 53:47.790
<b>- Sun-chan!
- Shiba!</b>

53:48.330 --> 53:49.790
<b>We won, didn't we?</b>

53:50.620 --> 53:52.620
<b>Yeah! We won!</b>

53:52.830 --> 53:54.040
<b>We did it!</b>

53:54.040 --> 53:56.590
<b>We're going to Koushien! Koushien!
Congrats...</b>

53:59.260 --> 54:01.300
<b>- I can't stop crying!
- Sun-chan, you're amazing!</b>

54:01.470 --> 54:03.510
<b>- Koushien! Koushien!
- One day, with everyone...</b>

54:03.510 --> 54:04.590
<b>Shiba!</b>

54:05.510 --> 54:06.970
<b>We got a lot more games left!</b>

54:08.100 --> 54:09.180
<b>Yeah!</b>

54:13.270 --> 54:15.980
<b>Hey, Sun-chan. About the last ball...</b>

54:15.980 --> 54:18.150
<b>Yeah. The last pitch...</b>

54:19.780 --> 54:20.860
<b>was a forkball.</b>

54:21.400 --> 54:23.030
<b>Figures.</b>

54:28.910 --> 54:29.870
<b>Hose.</b>

54:29.870 --> 54:31.250
<b>Hosecchi.</b>

54:31.250 --> 54:33.290
<b>We're not straightforward.</b>

54:33.290 --> 54:35.790
<b>We veer off along the way and make mistakes.</b>

54:35.790 --> 54:37.880
<b>But we still keep moving forward.</b>

54:40.340 --> 54:42.720
<b>A slightly bent victory sign.</b>

54:42.920 --> 54:45.470
<b>This is our winning shot.</b>

54:48.220 --> 54:49.600
<b>Aw, no. I almost forgot!</b>

54:50.720 --> 54:53.600
<b>Hey, Pansy. We had that promise, remember?</b>

54:54.350 --> 54:58.980
<b>If it's decided that Nishikizuta goes to Koushien,
you'll be my girlfriend.</b>

54:59.900 --> 55:00.650
<b>Y-Yes.</b>

55:01.400 --> 55:05.030
<b>Sorry, but I want to call that off.</b>

55:07.990 --> 55:09.080
<b>Sure.</b>

55:10.200 --> 55:11.290
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

55:11.580 --> 55:13.450
<b>Why are you apologizing?</b>

55:13.450 --> 55:15.790
<b>I'm the one who broke the promise.</b>

55:20.250 --> 55:22.250
<b>Well, I'm going back.</b>

55:22.550 --> 55:23.880
<b>See you, Pansy!</b>

55:24.550 --> 55:27.050
<b>Goodbye, Sun-chan.</b>

55:28.050 --> 55:31.140
<b>It's not over. It's not over yet!</b>

55:32.100 --> 55:36.350
<b>It's over when the six of us
have given our barrettes and the game is done.</b>

55:36.520 --> 55:40.020
<b>Th-Then I'll forcefully take
Sumireko's barrette if I have to!</b>

55:40.270 --> 55:43.480
<b>Naturally, stealing a barrette doesn't count.</b>

55:43.690 --> 55:47.450
<b>Then if some other girl gives me her barrette...</b>

55:47.450 --> 55:52.030
<b>Joro and Hose can only get barrettes
when the two of them are together.</b>

55:52.030 --> 55:53.120
<b>That's the rule.</b>

55:54.410 --> 55:56.370
<b>President Cherry! Tsukimi!</b>

55:56.370 --> 55:58.670
<b>Convince Sumireko!</b>

56:02.290 --> 56:04.380
<b>There's no way. I can't do that.</b>

56:04.880 --> 56:06.470
<b>Sorry, Hose.</b>

56:09.890 --> 56:12.390
<b>You finally resemble a human.</b>

56:13.890 --> 56:17.940
<b>Damn it! If not for you...
If it hadn't been for you...</b>

56:18.810 --> 56:21.770
<b>S-Sumireko! Give me your barrette!</b>

56:21.770 --> 56:24.230
<b>If you give it to me, it'll be a tie!</b>

56:28.320 --> 56:29.360
<b>It's okay.</b>

56:29.610 --> 56:31.570
<b>You can do what you want to do.</b>

56:32.120 --> 56:33.530
<b>It's not my decision.</b>

56:45.550 --> 56:47.590
<b>The girl from the flower dance!</b>

56:48.130 --> 56:49.090
<b>She's beautiful!</b>

57:00.140 --> 57:01.480
<b>Sumireko.</b>

57:01.480 --> 57:03.560
<b>Hazuki, I...</b>

57:03.560 --> 57:04.860
<b>Y-Yes?</b>

57:05.320 --> 57:06.610
<b>I...</b>

57:14.990 --> 57:17.580
<b>I'm in love with Joro.</b>

57:19.040 --> 57:20.040
<b>Pansy.</b>

57:24.170 --> 57:26.800
<b>Be with me. Forever.</b>

57:27.210 --> 57:29.840
<b>Thank you. I'm really happy.</b>

57:30.930 --> 57:32.590
<b>How?</b>

57:32.930 --> 57:34.600
<b>How could I have lost?</b>

57:34.600 --> 57:36.100
<b>You're an extra!</b>

57:36.100 --> 57:39.680
<b>An average, run-of-the-mill nobody!</b>

57:41.190 --> 57:44.060
<b>You're right. I'm a nobody.</b>

57:44.060 --> 57:46.770
<b>But I'm nobody's pawn.</b>

57:47.360 --> 57:52.570
<b>Nobody's a foil. No one exists
to make someone else look better.</b>

57:53.610 --> 57:55.030
<b>Also...</b>

57:56.450 --> 58:00.370
<b>an average, run-of-the-mill nobody
can't fight alone.</b>

58:05.750 --> 58:09.460
<b>The punishment
definitely applies to whomever loses.</b>

58:09.460 --> 58:15.050
<b>Never approach or talk to me
or any of my friends again.</b>

58:16.930 --> 58:19.220
<b>- Whoa, Hosecchi!
- Get a hold of yourself.</b>

58:25.350 --> 58:26.480
<b>This challenge...</b>

58:29.070 --> 58:32.280
<b>We all won it.</b>

58:36.370 --> 58:38.910
<b>Well, we're out of here.</b>

58:38.910 --> 58:39.580
<b>Bye-bye.</b>

58:39.790 --> 58:40.700
<b>Yeah.</b>

58:40.700 --> 58:42.660
<b>Bye, Cherry and Tsukimi!</b>

58:43.000 --> 58:45.370
<b>Well, now we've got the real moment of truth.</b>

58:45.370 --> 58:46.540
<b>- Yeah.
- Right.</b>

58:47.080 --> 58:49.550
<b>You mean there's something else?</b>

58:49.550 --> 58:52.800
<b>We've all told Joro that we love him.</b>

58:52.920 --> 58:55.510
<b>So now he's going to give us an answer.</b>

58:56.090 --> 58:59.510
<b>Wh-Wh...What?
He didn't tell me anything about that!</b>

59:00.100 --> 59:01.470
<b>Well, um...</b>

59:02.350 --> 59:03.730
<b>After all, I also...</b>

59:06.480 --> 59:07.440
<b>H-Hey.</b>

59:07.440 --> 59:09.900
<b>Whatever! Do what you want!</b>

59:09.900 --> 59:11.690
<b>Y-Yeah.</b>

59:13.280 --> 59:15.910
<b><i>But once you decide to do something, you do it!</i></b>

59:16.030 --> 59:18.280
<b><i>That's my motto!</i></b>

59:20.830 --> 59:24.290
<b>You all want to hear my answer, right?</b>

59:26.000 --> 59:27.330
<b>Here it is.</b>

59:36.510 --> 59:37.890
<b>The person I love is...</b>

59:41.510 --> 59:43.600
<b>Sumireko Sanshokuin.</b>

59:43.600 --> 59:45.520
<b>I love you, damn it.</b>

59:45.520 --> 59:47.600
<b>I want to be your boyfriend.</b>

59:50.940 --> 59:53.230
<b>Th-Thank you.</b>

59:55.360 --> 59:57.820
<b>U-Um, Joro...</b>

59:57.820 --> 01:00:00.570
<b>From now on, I want to... Huh?</b>

01:00:02.950 --> 01:00:04.370
<b>Sakura Akino.</b>

01:00:04.660 --> 01:00:06.210
<b>I love you.</b>

01:00:06.210 --> 01:00:08.000
<b>So please be my woman.</b>

01:00:11.670 --> 01:00:13.050
<b>Aoi Hinata.</b>

01:00:13.050 --> 01:00:15.050
<b>I want to go out with you.</b>

01:00:15.050 --> 01:00:16.470
<b>Be my girlfriend!</b>

01:00:19.590 --> 01:00:20.890
<b>Hina Hanetachi.</b>

01:00:20.890 --> 01:00:23.310
<b>Stay by my side for eternity.</b>

01:00:23.310 --> 01:00:24.310
<b>As my lover!</b>

01:00:30.900 --> 01:00:34.940
<b><i>Once you decide to do something, you do it!
That's my motto!</i></b>

01:00:37.320 --> 01:00:38.610
<b>What's the meaning of this?</b>

01:00:38.610 --> 01:00:40.870
<b>Oh, sorry, was it hard to understand?</b>

01:00:40.870 --> 01:00:42.120
<b>In a nutshell...</b>

01:00:43.030 --> 01:00:45.120
<b>Monday is for President Cosmos.</b>

01:00:45.120 --> 01:00:46.700
<b>Tuesday is Himawari's day.</b>

01:00:46.700 --> 01:00:48.460
<b>Wednesday belongs to Asunaro.</b>

01:00:48.460 --> 01:00:52.630
<b>And Thursday
is Pansy's turn to be my girlfriend.</b>

01:00:53.460 --> 01:00:56.210
<b>I mean, we love each other!</b>

01:00:56.210 --> 01:00:58.880
<b>Did you really think that would fly?</b>

01:00:59.180 --> 01:01:02.260
<b>Certainly, that leaves Friday open.</b>

01:01:02.390 --> 01:01:04.350
<b>But don't worry!</b>

01:01:05.560 --> 01:01:07.020
<b>Wh-What?</b>

01:01:07.020 --> 01:01:08.140
<b>Stare...</b>

01:01:08.140 --> 01:01:10.100
<b>What are you staring at?</b>

01:01:10.100 --> 01:01:13.150
<b>I have that day open,
so you get to be my Friday girl.</b>

01:01:14.190 --> 01:01:16.150
<b>I can sneak you in there.</b>

01:01:17.280 --> 01:01:19.780
<b>That solves it!</b>

01:01:22.070 --> 01:01:25.830
<b>- What's wrong? Are you overcome with emotion?
- D-D-D...</b>

01:01:25.830 --> 01:01:28.160
<b>Die!</b>

01:01:28.410 --> 01:01:32.420
<b>I-It can't be! Nowadays violent heroines
are on the outs, so how...</b>

01:01:32.420 --> 01:01:34.210
<b>Hmph! See you!</b>

01:01:36.250 --> 01:01:38.420
<b>Why don't we go too?</b>

01:01:38.420 --> 01:01:41.550
<b>And leave this industrial waste behind.</b>

01:01:41.970 --> 01:01:42.840
<b>Yeah.</b>

01:01:42.840 --> 01:01:44.010
<b>Good idea.</b>

01:01:44.010 --> 01:01:45.350
<b>Let's go!</b>

01:01:48.060 --> 01:01:50.180
<b>How did this happen?</b>

01:01:51.810 --> 01:01:57.320
<b>So after you made a doomed attempt
to date all of them, they got mad and left?</b>

01:01:57.780 --> 01:02:00.820
<b>There's no girl who'd go along
with an arrangement like that.</b>

01:02:00.820 --> 01:02:04.660
<b>That's fine. They're all still friends.</b>

01:02:05.700 --> 01:02:07.030
<b>So that's what it was about?</b>

01:02:07.030 --> 01:02:08.410
<b>Wh-What?</b>

01:02:08.410 --> 01:02:12.120
<b>Instead of becoming Pansy's boyfriend,
you gave her best friends, right?</b>

01:02:12.960 --> 01:02:18.800
<b>In fact, not only Pansy,
but Cosmos, Himawari, and Asunaro, too.</b>

01:02:20.880 --> 01:02:21.840
<b>It figures.</b>

01:02:22.760 --> 01:02:27.100
<b>You thought if you chose one,
it would fracture their relationships.</b>

01:02:27.100 --> 01:02:28.510
<b>Wrong.</b>

01:02:27.100 --> 01:02:30.430
<b>CHEERFUL SKEWERS</b>

01:02:29.390 --> 01:02:32.980
<b>In the first place, I'm in no position to choose.</b>

01:02:33.230 --> 01:02:35.900
<b>All I can do is report.</b>

01:02:37.110 --> 01:02:38.190
<b>I see.</b>

01:02:38.190 --> 01:02:40.280
<b>Well, I'd better get going.</b>

01:02:41.280 --> 01:02:44.950
<b>But Joro, do you know where that person is?</b>

01:02:45.320 --> 01:02:46.530
<b>Of course I do.</b>

01:02:47.450 --> 01:02:50.080
<b>We're talking about the person I love!</b>

01:02:51.620 --> 01:02:56.960
<b>Geez, if you go around talking like that,
Pansy and the others will get mad again.</b>

01:03:16.810 --> 01:03:19.150
<b>Hey! It took you long enough!</b>

01:03:23.070 --> 01:03:25.780
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

01:03:26.740 --> 01:03:28.990
<b>Didn't you tell me before?</b>

01:03:28.990 --> 01:03:32.240
<b>When you don't want anyone to see you crying,
you take the south exit.</b>

01:03:33.000 --> 01:03:35.250
<b>Then you should've stayed away!</b>

01:03:35.580 --> 01:03:38.250
<b>I didn't want anyone to see me!</b>

01:03:38.960 --> 01:03:41.340
<b>I can't agree to that.</b>

01:03:41.340 --> 01:03:43.920
<b>This was my top priority.</b>

01:03:46.800 --> 01:03:48.260
<b>You're an idiot.</b>

01:03:48.590 --> 01:03:50.810
<b>Do you remember that one promise?</b>

01:03:50.810 --> 01:03:51.970
<b>Promise?</b>

01:03:52.430 --> 01:03:58.690
<b>The competition we had at the pool,
where you have to do whatever the winner says.</b>

01:03:58.690 --> 01:04:00.310
<b>Oh, that.</b>

01:04:00.900 --> 01:04:03.030
<b>Go ahead. Say anything.</b>

01:04:05.780 --> 01:04:08.610
<b>Let's share those skewers.</b>

01:04:08.860 --> 01:04:10.450
<b>That's your command?</b>

01:04:10.450 --> 01:04:11.330
<b>Yeah.</b>

01:04:11.660 --> 01:04:13.240
<b>That's what I want.</b>

01:04:14.080 --> 01:04:15.290
<b>Is that a no?</b>

01:04:17.620 --> 01:04:18.870
<b>It works for me!</b>

01:04:23.000 --> 01:04:25.920
<b>Let's see, a good place...</b>

01:04:26.720 --> 01:04:28.010
<b>How about there?</b>

01:04:37.060 --> 01:04:38.890
<b>It can't be...</b>

01:04:41.650 --> 01:04:43.230
<b>Come on, let's eat!</b>

01:04:43.820 --> 01:04:45.070
<b>Thanks.</b>

01:04:46.900 --> 01:04:49.070
<b>What are you doing? It's going to get cold!</b>

01:04:49.070 --> 01:04:50.030
<b>Right.</b>

01:04:53.580 --> 01:04:55.040
<b>It's delicious.</b>

01:04:55.040 --> 01:04:56.500
<b>Yeah, right?</b>

01:04:59.000 --> 01:05:01.630
<b>Yum! Praise Tsubaki!</b>

01:05:01.630 --> 01:05:02.540
<b>Yeah.</b>

01:05:02.540 --> 01:05:06.130
<b>If you dawdle,
I'm going to eat them all, best friend!</b>

01:05:06.550 --> 01:05:08.800
<b><i>Hey, you're up, Sun-chan!</i></b>

01:05:12.970 --> 01:05:14.720
<b>Delicious!</b>

01:05:14.930 --> 01:05:17.930
<b>I'll show you how to gobble down a kabob!</b>

01:05:17.930 --> 01:05:20.140
<b>You're finally getting hungry, huh?</b>

01:05:20.810 --> 01:05:21.980
<b>Hey, Joro!</b>

01:05:22.100 --> 01:05:25.860
<b>I won today. I'm going to Koushien!</b>

01:05:26.690 --> 01:05:28.320
<b>What do you think? Isn't that awesome?</b>

01:05:28.320 --> 01:05:30.700
<b>Yeah, you're awesome, Sun-chan!</b>

01:05:30.700 --> 01:05:32.410
<b>That's my best friend!</b>

01:05:32.410 --> 01:05:33.950
<b>Of course!</b>

01:05:34.580 --> 01:05:36.410
<b>Now you're getting excited.</b>

01:05:36.410 --> 01:05:38.830
<b>This is the way I am!</b>

01:05:38.830 --> 01:05:42.120
<b>Yeah. This is the way you are, Sun-chan.</b>

01:05:43.710 --> 01:05:46.130
<b><i>Hey, Joro, you knew it, right?</i></b>

01:05:46.800 --> 01:05:50.340
<b><i>Himawari and Cosmos were in love with me.</i></b>

01:05:51.220 --> 01:05:55.930
<b><i>But then the next thing I know,
they all fell in love with you.</i></b>

01:05:56.470 --> 01:05:59.270
<b><i>One by one, they all accepted you.</i></b>

01:06:00.310 --> 01:06:02.100
<b><i>I want you to be my girlfriend.</i></b>

01:06:09.030 --> 01:06:11.860
<b><i>Whereas Oga's cycle of rejection continued.</i></b>

01:06:12.280 --> 01:06:16.580
<b><i>Why are you the only one
who accepts that Oga?</i></b>

01:06:16.830 --> 01:06:20.330
<b><i>If possible,
I really wanted a cute girl to be the one.</i></b>

01:06:20.790 --> 01:06:22.290
<b>What's wrong, Sun-chan?</b>

01:06:23.670 --> 01:06:27.210
<b>Are you the only one who loves me?</b>

01:06:31.300 --> 01:06:32.760
<b>I ate too much.</b>

01:06:32.760 --> 01:06:35.090
<b>No more food for the rest of the day.</b>

01:06:37.760 --> 01:06:39.270
<b>Good evening...</b>

01:06:39.270 --> 01:06:41.770
<b>Joro, who loves his friend.</b>

01:06:44.190 --> 01:06:47.190
<b>Wh-What do you want, Pansy?</b>

01:06:47.190 --> 01:06:51.570
<b>I have something to say to the industrial waste
in front of me, so I've been waiting.</b>

01:06:51.570 --> 01:06:53.280
<b>Something to say to me?</b>

01:06:53.280 --> 01:06:54.450
<b>Yes.</b>

01:06:54.990 --> 01:06:56.570
<b>Well...</b>

01:06:58.950 --> 01:07:00.200
<b>Thank you.</b>

01:07:00.200 --> 01:07:02.870
<b>You kept your promise to me,
the one you made when we first met.</b>

01:07:03.960 --> 01:07:06.080
<b>You remembered, didn't you?</b>

01:07:06.210 --> 01:07:07.500
<b>Who knows?</b>

01:07:09.300 --> 01:07:12.880
<b>We can all keep meeting in the school library.</b>

01:07:12.880 --> 01:07:15.510
<b>That makes me very, very happy.</b>

01:07:16.930 --> 01:07:17.930
<b>Well, I'd better—</b>

01:07:17.930 --> 01:07:18.760
<b>Wait.</b>

01:07:19.970 --> 01:07:23.930
<b>I'm buying my dinner at the convenience store,
so I'll walk that far with you.</b>

01:07:27.440 --> 01:07:28.770
<b>Just this once.</b>

01:07:33.150 --> 01:07:34.530
<b>You know, Joro...</b>

01:07:35.490 --> 01:07:40.410
<b>I really do love you.</b>

01:07:42.790 --> 01:07:45.460
<b>The moon is pretty tonight, huh?</b>
